<title>UK: Bulker refloated at Saudi port with barley.</title>
<headline>Bulker refloated at Saudi port with barley.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulk carrier Qena was refloated at the Saudi Arabian port of Dammam, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Egyptian-flag 38,319-dwt Qena, carrying a cargo of barley, ran aground on January 27.</p>
<p>The vessel was taken to an inner anchorage to await a berth, which may become available on February 13.</p>
</text>
